name showcharinbox
category Package
revision 29803
shortdesc Show characters inside a box
relocated 1
longdesc The package typesets a character inside a box, showing where
longdesc reference point is, and displaying width, height, and depth
longdesc information of the character. The output is like that on page
longdesc 63 of "The TeXBook" or page 101 of "The METAFONTbook". The
longdesc package itself is motivated by Knuth's macros in the file
longdesc manmac.tex. Users should note that using a small size for the
longdesc character inside the box does not make any sense: use a large
longdesc size.
runfiles size=1
 RELOC/tex/latex/showcharinbox/showcharinbox.sty
